{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "9c7623eec03d12137578b45c1e753f3d84e8b82a49f6bed760e226b0b05117bf", "ja": "公正な判断", "zh": "公正的判断", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c60f501505edc2ebce580a64d18fe31d80fa9130ed26fb4650d8a49a59fbb6d4", "ja": "侵入したのは、番組に応募した高校生の一人\nだった。勢いで交渉に来たものの既に反省し\nて、公平に審査を行ってほしいからと学校名\nを明かさず帰る。そしてのり子たちは全部の\n資料を見て、出演先の高校を決める。", "zh": "闯入者是报名参加节目的高中生之一。  \n虽然一时冲动前来交涉，但他已经反省，  \n为了让评审能够公平进行，便没有透露校名就离开了。  \n之后，法子她们看完所有资料，决定出演的高中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f1ade17d711fab84810f4d303bc19f4d3a85bb7850f8aa5a4b25b1cc617a29f7", "ja": "（突然現れ、突然去ろうとした女子高生をどうにか\n引き止め、訳ありらしいので話を聞くことにした）", "zh": "（好不容易拦住了突然出现又突然要离开的女高中生，见她似乎有什么难言之隐，便决定听听她的事情。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "6a734d7ccb96745f7119d42fd32be2456fd1a99fc973cdc8f0e3360ee800c946", "ja": "結菜ちゃん……だったよね。\nそっか、あの番組に応募してくれたんだ。", "zh": "结菜……对吧。\n这样啊，你报名参加了那个节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1002_yuina", "source_sha256": "cdab6ffa7e10b7dee7c1bf98ec8a741e4db44804c340a81b3cfd049b4c37f081", "ja": "は、はい。本当に、突然申し訳ありません！\nまさか、中に招いていただけるなんて……。", "zh": "是、是的。真的很抱歉突然打扰您！没想到您竟然会邀请我进去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "e65118387ad247312a7b10c99ff284a7d2175f5dd0b215afff6b0783f0c0c788", "ja": "気にしないでね。私たちもファンの皆さんのために、\nできる限りのことをしたいっていつも思ってるの。", "zh": "别在意哦。我们也一直想着，要为各位粉丝尽可能地做些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "eb0e5ae2155fe3ff3b0e860438efd5d26be5f7dbf0c6da3c0639f045b6c76307", "ja": "きっと何か深い訳があるんですよね？\nでないと、こんなことできないと思う……。", "zh": "一定有些什么深层原因吧？不然，我觉得是做不出这种事的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1005_yuina", "source_sha256": "b2abbd94def64cbb01d5cbecb93efd73aa5e2149a94dfef46800ceab75c313bd", "ja": "は、はい。でも、深い訳というか……\n居てもたってもいられなくって、それで……。", "zh": "是、是的。不过，要说是什么深层理由吧……  \n实在是坐立不安，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1006_yuina", "source_sha256": "53e6868e911b7e05d80314cd43d20d431d81fe34966ccf2fa9df1743e3a26588", "ja": "やっぱり、こんなのだめです！　さっきも流されて\nここまで来ちゃいましたけど……", "zh": "果然，这样是不行的！刚才也是随波逐流\n就跟着来到这里了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1007_yuina", "source_sha256": "2632efbd26b47fe601d69fb490dcbde3997cd86df8fc4b40ffbcefc0c459a080", "ja": "押しかけて話を聞いてもらうなんて、ルール違反だと\n思うんです！　だから、応募は取り下げてください！", "zh": "我觉得，贸然找上门让人听自己说话，是违反规则的！所以，请撤回申请吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "67b66011c60f58f6e2d4a26222cfa38095796bf554d2748e4fcd90fee55c4f2c", "ja": "ええっ！？　せ、せっかくここまで来たのに……？", "zh": "诶诶！？好、好不容易都到这里了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "692ecd818686e9a4bb1b6707e58011a7193941ea53851381ec269374c2425486", "ja": "ちょっと待って、結菜さん、一回落ち着いて！？", "zh": "等一下，结菜，你先冷静一下！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "e91f1705f25dc1e2e58b4f9af1ab3aea3f384a4f6c11f4903a6268036d9889d6", "ja": "たしかにルール違反かもしれないけど、わかってても\n来ちゃうくらいの思いがあるってことでしょ？", "zh": "确实可能违反规则，但明知道如此还是会过来，也就是说有着无论如何都想来的强烈心情吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "9c2f9b5f2f61dc853c95546ae3648d5e51f31943c093bc681addd88b3f33c67b", "ja": "そんな強い思い、とにかく一回受け止めてみないと、\nアタシたちも寝覚めが悪いじゃん。", "zh": "那么强烈的心意，不管怎样也得先接纳一次，不然我们心里也过意不去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1012_yuina", "source_sha256": "609b468be2c60eb271e93c32f1e498b0cbee6939c1c29c4e16fa46b36c5122e0", "ja": "のり子ちゃ……、のり子さん。", "zh": "诺莉子……，诺莉子小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "6fadf318a8455c26f9ed10ca4bae2d6a11b210fc3caa1ec0b6d9c916fcdcc974", "ja": "だから応募取り下げはナシ！　でも、応募してくれた\n内容だけで決める！　……これでどうかな？", "zh": "所以，不许撤回申请！不过，会只根据你提交的内容来决定！……这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1014_yuina", "source_sha256": "d6991dd568b71972f6000ec6bfcaadc00c224c6bc67aa773073461c562237caf", "ja": "……。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "……非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1015_yuina", "source_sha256": "681969d3566db35ac382f4cc959fa22eb15178a7854a3a8ce0d20de87319ddb6", "ja": "……私、動画を応募しました。\nそれを見て……もらえたらと思います。", "zh": "……我投递了应征视频。\n希望……您能看一看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "17c6ad10e3640cf2685ababdc9dcb782a7e36a4fa71a8d7783cc5033a0e2213b", "ja": "今ちょうどみんなで確認していたところだったんです！\n結菜さんが応募してくれたのは、どれですか？", "zh": "我们刚好正在一起确认呢！\n结菜小姐投稿的是哪一个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1017_yuina", "source_sha256": "fb52dccb498a6053491957079c3bf02119414b6a58532f94b877ac08cf79edfc", "ja": "い、いえ、公正に判断してもらいたいので、\nどんなのかは言いませんっ。", "zh": "不、不是，因为我想让您公正地判断，\n所以不会告诉您是什么样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1018_yuina", "source_sha256": "f46e95f7bffe648fd53ad824ac19ebf38da69c8bafcec015f5eb75ce959d0616", "ja": "でも、あの中にすべて詰めました。\nよかったら……見てください。", "zh": "但是，已经把一切都装进里面了。\n如果你愿意……请看一看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "113b2214d703f97922b106b4013f2c72bfd8aa5a8bc87e4cf8efef009389f0b6", "ja": "……うん。わかった。", "zh": "……嗯，知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1020_yuina", "source_sha256": "24a87aafcd5d4832ec5912fe040fe00875cff31d52d331873077faf6d7f16d55", "ja": "あの、今日は本当にすみませんでした！　なのに……\n話を聞いてくれて、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "那个，今天真的非常抱歉！明明这样……\n谢谢你愿意听我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1021_yuina", "source_sha256": "303185d430058f4860804f91de0aefdffa70aee21444a84eda96a32fc4236974", "ja": "では、し、失礼しますっ！", "zh": "那么，我、我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1022_se", "source_sha256": "5eb294583bc6f40ad4e1df90eb85c503fc9ab6b6afb330bcf1c8be5b6f361216", "ja": "タッタッタ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d61e2567501ce0bf4485fcfd026a37aff5da460047636887d8656ccd5d116d85", "ja": "……嵐みたいな子だったなぁ。", "zh": "……真是个暴风雨般的女孩子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "4969c9e5febb39b8d057bc9524f63519f74e1948371e7af7265c28e5c24511a4", "ja": "お、応募資料の中に、結菜さんが送ったものも\nあるんですね。ちゃんと、全部見ましょう。", "zh": "哦，报名资料里也有结菜小姐提交的呢。我们好好把全部都看一遍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "2e1eef1a3841e7722816f16d35ace9ade7b798aa482b43260bb6fff8d21bec8c", "ja": "うん。それで、公正に判断しよう！\nそれが約束だからね！", "zh": "嗯！那就公平地做出判断吧！因为这可是约定好的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1026_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "1f990a8472ea751574ee90b6c7746549360d5f2a30d6a03305f9e0f31efe52c6", "ja": "ふう。これで全部見たことになるかな。どれもこれも\n熱が籠っていて、いやあ、すごかった。", "zh": "呼……这样就算全部看过一遍了吧。每一件作品都饱含热情，真是太厉害了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "83a881760307b7f4d794a65dea73111c969735dd69e0967c5d61557d5006f623", "ja": "だね。でも、アタシは決まったかも。", "zh": "对。不过，我可能已经决定好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "17b25ce8de8123fd540758fa5412499db1300a2687207a0928fecc3a8f31375f", "ja": "わ、私も。", "zh": "我、我也决定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1030_027say", "source_sha256": "63c905f25b8ddcd7830ccf7e1f3fbfdd9f1ed008b975779a0dfa57e3d21e0acc", "ja": "私もです。ふふっ。", "zh": "我也是。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "7a68cbeed226d86860f9cd6fdba38e8e29716ecbb070860a1d2ace4111dee18c", "ja": "せーので言う？", "zh": "要不要一起喊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "96d489a261aa18ac07e2e9dba7d01a93bf8c05449a5be4b60b02cb41e1d6a558", "ja": "それじゃ。せ～のっ♪", "zh": "那就……预备——起！♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "f3157a4bf585af47bbd7a352f0db0d10b2f9b971a4d9aaf44596be6e97bbc5cb", "ja": "（そして全員が同じ高校名を言った。満場一致だった）", "zh": "（然后，所有人都说出了同一个高中名。结果全票通过。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "6396ecb1875fe7ccc408dfa77b58e8948dadb7b4ffa3db1034d31e159e29c2d5", "ja": "どの高校もすごい熱量だったし、クオリティが\nすごく高いのもたくさんあって……。", "zh": "每所高中都充满了热情，而且还有很多作品的质量非常高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "eb88a0b52eb1dc4e7030e840a6247ccb00633d157d92cb291de4888d3cc58ba2", "ja": "でも、あの高校が抜きんでてたのは……想いの強さ、\nかな。人間の、生身の感情が伝わってきた……。", "zh": "不过，那所高中的表现之所以格外突出……大概是因为他们的情感特别强烈吧。那种属于人类、发自内心的情感，真真切切地传达了过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1036_010azu", "source_sha256": "f63b4ea504f353ec6aa1307a4282b16c9e0014fe99138cdd50f885dcc6ecfd1f", "ja": "そうね、本当にそうだったわ。\nはぁ……青春って、いいわね～。うふふ♪", "zh": "是啊，真的就是那样呢。\n唉……青春真好呀～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0420_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "5a7b1a6ebf5a47be2146c3b5bdda48c73bf252d8216499417d930564e15add6a", "ja": "じゃ、決まりだ！　番組には連絡しておくから、\nみんなは引き続きレッスンを頑張ってくれ。", "zh": "那就这么定了！我会联系节目组的，  \n大家接下来也要好好努力练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
